  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Cha 15, braggart level 5, leader’s approach</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Choose one combat sphere other than Warleader. Whenever an ally benefiting from one of your shouts hits with an attack action using a sphere ability or combat talent from that sphere, they treat their attack roll as 1 higher for the purposes of applying a flair. At braggart level 15, they treat it as an additional 1 higher.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat may be taken multiple times. Its effect do not stack. Instead, you must choose a different combat sphere each time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/braggart#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
